{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.JonquiereCyclotomicTateRationality","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.JonquiereCyclotomicTateRationality","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Infra.Clausen","lean:module:QOU.Infra.Polylogarithm"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.JonquiereCyclotomicTateRationality.jonquiere_tate_rationality","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.JonquiereCyclotomicTateRationality.jonquiere_tate_rationality","kind":"def","line":17,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/JonquiereCyclotomicTateRationality.lean#L17-L25","doc":"**Theorem (`prop:jonquiere-cyclotomic-tate-rationality`).**\nFor every `n ≥ 2` and `K ≥ 2`, the Jonquière \"wrong-parity\"\nclosed form (RHS of the inversion formula) is well-defined.\nSubstantive identification with the actual polylog inversion\nis encoded conditionally. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:jonquiere-cyclotomic-tate-rationality","label":"prop:jonquiere-cyclotomic-tate-rationality","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/jonquiere-cyclotomic-tate-rationality.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}